        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sleep Gas"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, mental, poison, sleep)\n\nThe verdurous ooze adjusts its aura of supernatural vapors to affect living creatures within a 20-foot emanation, forcing them to attempt a 24 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to Sleep Gas for 24 hours.\n- **Success:** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature falls unconscious. If it's still unconscious after 1 minute, it wakes up automatically.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature falls unconscious. If it's still unconscious after 1 hour, it wakes up automatically."
            },
